%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dTry going on a date with one of them. You might find\nsomething you like about them that could change your\nperspective.\d%K%P
「约会一次再交往的话不就好了嘛。\n那样的话就会接触到他不为人知的魅力，\n渐渐就会喜欢上他了吧」%K%P
