I had seen that person before. He used to run one of the\nbiggest banks in central Japan.%K%P
那个人我也见过。\n总部曾经位于中部地区的都银的原董事长…%K%P
He was the most active when I was still living in Gifu. I\nsaw him on the news pretty much on a weekly basis.%K%P
在我还在当地住的时候还是现任，\n每周都出现在当地新闻上。%K%P
I heard he resigned when his bank merged with one of our\nconglomerates, but apparently he became an adviser for the\nSawashimas before I knew it.%K%P
我记得是在与财阀系都银的大型合并时辞职了，\n不知什么时候，就成了泽嶋的顾问。%K%P
