Nonetheless...%K%P
即使如此…%K%P
Himeo acted perfectly natural even when surrounded by all\nthose people.%K%P
被这些看上去都难以对付的人包围，\n姬绪小姐一步也没退缩。%K%P
As the only daughter of Sawashima Junpei, Himeo must've\nenjoyed the attention and admiration of the higher circles\nof power, yet that wasn't merely something rooted in her\nsocial status alone.%K%P
那个嘛，毕竟是泽嶋家的独生女，\n这些大人物面对她自然是要让步，\n但这并不只是因为立场上有优势。%K%P
I didn't know how to put it, but there was a certain kind\nof bewitching elegance to her current disposition. Even\nthe hotel attendants seemed overwhelmed by her.%K%P
该怎么说呢，有光环笼罩着。\n老实说，这种光环甚至能压过酒店的礼仪小姐。%K%P
