%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I once again had to admit just how firm a grasp she had on\nthese kind of social interactions.%K%P
虽说早就明白这件事…\n不过她确实有着把这种显眼的地方特殊化的能力。%K%P
It was no doubt the combined effects of both her\nupbringing and inborn talent.%K%P
这是从儿时起就在无意识里被锻炼出来的能力，\n而且恐怕是天生就拥有的能力。%K%P
I fought her on a battlefield that was never hers to begin\nwith and I'd forced her into the shoes of an average\nemployee.%K%P
最近她被强行当作新进职员来对待，\n让她在不擅长的地方苦战了吧。%K%P
But now that she was on her home field, Himeo proved to be\nfar more beneficial to Michihama Trading than I ever\ncould.%K%P
